data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Corollary 14.4.11; Corollary 14.4.12(i),(ii); printed p.399 / PDF p.419"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_K\">\\(\\le_K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9d68ed64bfec741d\" href=\"?note=9d68ed64bfec741d\" title=\"43-df-complexity-red\">43-df-complexity-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d6812f594e37d97c\" href=\"?note=d6812f594e37d97c\" title=\"43-df-vl-red\">43-df-vl-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\le_KY\\Rightarrow X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\le_KY\\Rightarrow X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(X\\le_KY\\land\\mathrm{Random}_n(X))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Random}_n(Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(X\\le_KY\\land\\mathrm{Random}_n(X))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Random}_n(Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X\\oplus Y)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\exists Z\\in2^\\omega\\;(X\\le_KZ\\land Y\\le_KZ).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X\\oplus Y)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\exists Z\\in2^\\omega\\;(X\\le_KZ\\land Y\\le_KZ).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>精化的关键是Theorem 14.4.10：每个随机直和的真假由适当长度处的初段K复杂度判定。本条只录无需额外整数编码约定的归约结论；不把原稿中的x↾(z↾n)当作未声明的自然数参数。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Corollary 14.4.11; Corollary 14.4.12(i),(ii); printed p.399 / PDF p.419。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-complexity-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-vl-red","status":"resolved","id":"d6812f594e37d97c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-vl-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\le_K$、$\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}$、$\\mathrm{Random}_n$、$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\oplus$ 采用 [[43-df-complexity-red]]、[[43-df-vl-red]]、[[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-vl-red","status":"resolved","id":"d6812f594e37d97c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\le_K$、$\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}$、$\\mathrm{Random}_n$、$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\oplus$ 采用 [[43-df-complexity-red]]、[[43-df-vl-red]]、[[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\le_K$、$\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}$、$\\mathrm{Random}_n$、$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\oplus$ 采用 [[43-df-complexity-red]]、[[43-df-vl-red]]、[[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\o